        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Ordered Pizza from here without really hearing much about it, and it may have been the best decision I made.\n\nThe Tandoori Pizza is definitely worth a try, it was like having Indian food in Pizza form. I highly recommend it if you're looking for a different take on Pizza!!",
        "time": 1745021738,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ryan Smith",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109940870807321608936/reviews",
