        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUZEIl_AG5kYeszDOrKCt7C9bU0LbdbTotjfC2Hxrt-2YuTdXc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "We had the chicken parmesan pizza, the tandoori chicken pizza and the fries.\nWe really enjoyed the chicken parmesan pizza.\nThe tandoori chicken pizza was good, but less our taste.\nThe fries were really good, they appeared to be Cosco fries that they added seasoning to and fried a second time.\n\nThe staff seemed very friendly when we interacted with them.",
        "time": 1745504135,
        "translated": false
